OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:      
OL,6,FCloudy and frosty on Thursday with     
OL,7,Fsome morning sunshine. Turning mild,   
OL,8,Fwet and windy into Friday as a front   
OL,9,Fsweeps through, but then drier and     
OL,10,Fbrighter for most on Saturday.         
